			"notes": "## Changes in this release\n\n- **Refactored mob raycasting system**  \n  The damage indicator can now retrieve information from mobs at much greater distances. The maximum distance is fully configurable in the mod settings.\n\n- **Refactored time and status display system (StatusIndicator)**  \n  The top-of-screen info line can now display fully custom text, making it ideal for streamers. It supports in-game variables such as:  \n  - Player name  \n  - In-game time (24h or 12h format)  \n  - Real playtime in the world  \n  - Target block position in chunk coordinates  \n\n- **More variables coming soon**  \n  Future updates will add many more options for custom data display.\n\n- **Custom formatting**  \n  Supports ARGB color codes and line breaks for full control over appearance."
		},
