			"notes": "### New Features\n- **Customizable Durability Display**  \n  The config file now allows you to define the exact format for showing armor, shield, and tool durability. Three new variables give you full control over how the information is presented.\n\n### Existing Features (from previous updates)\n- **Damage Indicator** – Shows the health of the entity you are looking at.\n- **Durability Indicator** – Displays remaining durability for armor, tools, and shields.\n- **Time Indicator** – Shows in-game time, configurable for realism or convenience.\n- **In-Chunk LookAt Position** – Displays the coordinates of the block you are currently looking at within the current chunk."
